# DDEV writes mkcert certificates and generated router YAML here on start.
# Do not ignore the whole tree, and do not commit a top-level `tls:` YAML.
# A `tls:` fragment replaces mkcert in the merged Traefik config and HTTPS
# fails with unrecognized_name (ERR_SSL_UNRECOGNIZED_NAME_ALERT).
certs/
*_merged.yaml
